[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーし。これで最後だ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright! That's the last one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ようやく終わったね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're finally finished."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。みんなのおかげで、これで全部終わったよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah. Thanks to everyone, it's all done now."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユミアたちは、これからどうするの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you all planning to do now?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちは、元の世界に戻る方法を探すつもり",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're going to look for a way back to our world."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか。寂しくなっちゃうね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see. It'll be lonely without you around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうでもないさ。レスナの話によれば、\n僕たちがこの世界に来たのは事情がありそうだからな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not necessarily. According to Resna, there might be more to why we came to this world."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もしアウグストとザスキア……前文明の錬金術士の\n仕業だとしたら、私も錬金術士として無関係じゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If August and Saskia... if the ancient civilization's alchemists are behind this, then as an alchemist myself, I can't just ignore it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "な、なんだかすみません",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'm sorry about all this..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ホントに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, you don't need to—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なに謝ってるの。みんなのせいじゃないでしょ？\n私たちは調査団。この世界の秘密、面白いじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you apologizing for? None of this is anyone's fault. We're members of a research team, and the secrets of this world are fascinating."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ニーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それに、違う世界のことを知れるのも、\nすっごい楽しいから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Besides, learning about a different world is super interesting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レイニャも、皆さんと知り合えて、嬉しいですし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I'm just happy I got to meet everyone!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レイニャ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lenja"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁ……変なことには巻き込まれたけど、\nおもしれえモンが見つかるかもしれねえしな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well... we might've gotten mixed up in some weird stuff, but who knows what other interesting things we'll find."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "僕たちはこの世界の秘密を探り、ザスキアたちを\n追い詰めなければならないと思っている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We need to uncover this world's secrets and track down Saskia and the others."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だから……僕たち調査団の目的は、\n君たちの目的とも重なるというわけだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So... our team's goals align with yours."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴィクトル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Viktor"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え……えっと？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um... what do you mean?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "つまり、これからもよろしくってこと！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "He means we'll be sticking around!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユミア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yumia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000これからもよろしくね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Looking forward to working together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]